<title>USA: TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LOS ANGELES OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $303,000</p>
<p>Infiniti Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Olivier Delaitre (France)</p>
<p>7-5 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>4-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Glenn Weiner (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>5-7 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Mahesh Bhupathi (India) 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Byron Black (Zimbabwe) beat Justin Gimelstob (U.S.) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1)</p>
</text>
